            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa majeshi anaamba, “Lola, ninatanguliza muhumwa wangu mberezo ndiye nitayarishira njira. Iye Mwenyezi Mlungu mumlondaye andakpwedza kpwenye Nyumba ya kuvoya Mlungu gafula. Lolani hiye muhumwa wa chilagane mumlondaye aredza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
